---
import AnimeSliderStatic from "../AnimeSlider/AnimeSliderStatic.astro";
const sliderData = Astro.props.info;
---

<div class="section-header">
  <span class="section-badge"> 💜 Recommended by AniKawa </span>

  <h2 class="section-title">Editor's Picks</h2>

  <p class="section-subtitle">
    Not just popular anime—these are the series we genuinely believe every fan
    should experience at least once.
  </p>
  <AnimeSliderStatic info={sliderData} />
  <section class="editors-note-section">
    <div class="editors-note-container">
      <div class="editors-note-card">
        <span class="section-badge"> 💜 Why These Made Our List </span>

        <h2 class="section-title">More Than Just Popular Anime</h2>

        <div class="editors-note-content">
          <p>
            Every anime in this collection was selected for a different reason.
            Some are hidden gems that deserve more attention, some tell stories
            you'll remember for years, and others simply offer a viewing
            experience that feels refreshingly different from the mainstream.
            Rather than recommending only the most popular titles, we wanted to
            highlight anime that surprised us, stayed with us long after the
            credits rolled, or brought something unique to the medium.
          </p>

          <p>
            From the emotional journey of <strong
              >A Place Further Than the Universe</strong
            >
            and the quiet mystery of <strong
              >Shoshimin: How to Become Ordinary</strong
            >
            to the dreamlike storytelling of <strong>Sonny Boy</strong> and the heartfelt
            nostalgia of <strong>Orange</strong>, each series here has earned
            its place for a reason. You'll also find underrated fantasy
            adventures, ambitious originals, and a few divisive picks that we
            believe are worth experiencing and judging for yourself.
          </p>

          <p>
            If you're tired of seeing the same recommendations everywhere, this
            list is our invitation to try something different. Some of these
            anime may become your next favorite, while others might simply show
            you a side of anime you haven't explored before—and that's exactly
            why we chose them.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
